@startuml
title Controlled Complaint Status Workflow
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> SUBMITTED
SUBMITTED --> UNDER_REVIEW : assessment begins
UNDER_REVIEW --> IN_PROGRESS : accepted for processing
UNDER_REVIEW --> AWAITING_INFORMATION : clarification required
UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : invalid/out of scope + reason
AWAITING_INFORMATION --> UNDER_REVIEW : information received
IN_PROGRESS --> AWAITING_INFORMATION : more information required
IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : work completed
RESOLVED --> CLOSED : resolution finalized
RESOLVED --> IN_PROGRESS : reopen with reason
REJECTED --> CLOSED : rejection finalized
REJECTED --> UNDER_REVIEW : authorized reversal
CLOSED --> [*]

note right of CLOSED
  Reopening a closed complaint is not
  permitted until a specific administrator
  rule is approved.
end note

note bottom
  Reassignment is a parallel request lifecycle,
  not a complaint status.
end note
@enduml

